From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Clint Goudie-Nice <clint-goudie-nice@example.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:08:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] saibcm-modules-legacy-th: install and load linux-bcm-genl
 (sFlow)

The legacy-TH SAI (libsaibcm 13.2.1.100) sets a port's sFlow sampling
rate through /proc/bcm/genl/psample/rate, which only linux-bcm-genl
creates. The legacy-TH SDK builds that module (systems/linux/user/
common/Makefile: BUILD_BCM_GENL=1, $(BCM_GENL) stripped beside
linux-knet-cb.ko), but opennsl-modules.install never ships it and
opennsl-modules.init never loads it. So every sFlow session on a
legacy-TH switch fails in the SAI:

  SAI_API_PORT:_brcm_sai_port_proc_samplerate_set:18439 cannot open
  knet link sample proc
  sflowAddPort: Failed to set session ... on port ...

This is the classic-XGS (non-ltsw) half of what sonic-net/
sonic-buildimage#26360 did for the XGS package's sdklt bcmgenl: ship the
module, load it after linux-knet-cb (so linux-bcm-knet already has its
parameters), and unload it before psample, which it uses.

Measured on a Celestica DX010 (202511, legacy-TH SAI 13.2.1.100) by
loading the build's own linux-bcm-genl.ko by hand: /proc/bcm/genl/
psample/{rate,size,stats,debug} appear, SAI_PORT_ATTR_INGRESS_
SAMPLEPACKET_ENABLE then answers SAI_STATUS_SUCCESS, and a port sampled
at 1:256 delivered 168 psample packets for 40,000 received frames. A
module loaded after the SAI has made its netifs does not know them
("Failed setting psample rate on unknown network interface"), so the
samples carried no ingress ifindex and a rate of 1: it has to be loaded
here, before syncd starts.
---
 .../saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.init        | 2 ++
 .../saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.install     | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.init b/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.init
index d9fe27ae2..23c34b3bc 100755
--- a/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.init
+++ b/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.init
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ function load_kernel_modules()
 
         modprobe linux-bcm-knet use_rx_skb=1 rx_buffer_size=9238 debug=0x5020 default_mtu=9100
         modprobe linux-knet-cb
+        modprobe linux-bcm-genl
         modprobe linux_ngbde
     fi
 }
@@ -68,6 +69,7 @@ function remove_kernel_modules()
         rmmod linux_ngbde
         rmmod psample
     else
+        rmmod linux-bcm-genl
         rmmod psample
         rmmod linux-knet-cb
         rmmod linux-bcm-knet
diff --git a/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.install b/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.install
index 36e15a854..9f98f2e38 100644
--- a/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.install
+++ b/platform/broadcom/saibcm-modules-legacy-th/debian/opennsl-modules.install
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@ systems/linux/user/x86-smp_generic_64-2_6/linux-bcm-knet.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+
 systems/linux/user/x86-smp_generic_64-2_6/linux-kernel-bde.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
 systems/linux/user/x86-smp_generic_64-2_6/linux-user-bde.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
 systems/linux/user/x86-smp_generic_64-2_6/linux-knet-cb.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
+systems/linux/user/x86-smp_generic_64-2_6/linux-bcm-genl.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
 systemd/opennsl-modules.service lib/systemd/system
 sdklt/build/bde/linux_ngbde.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
 sdklt/build/knet/linux_ngknet.ko lib/modules/6.12.41+deb13-sonic-amd64/extra
